<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS LOWER IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS LOWER IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $0-7/8 lower at $44-1/4 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 202.3 markka.</p>
<p>By 1345 GMT, it had fallen further to $44, which corresponds to 201.13 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
